@baseUrl = https://localhost:7295
@tenantToken = THAY_BANG_JWT_TENANT
@landlordToken = THAY_BANG_JWT_LANDLORD
@otherToken = THAY_BANG_JWT_NGUOI_KHAC
@bookingId = THAY_BANG_GUID_BOOKING_ACCEPTED
@contractId = THAY_BANG_GUID_HOP_DONG

### 1. Tenant tao hop dong nhap tu Booking Accepted
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/from-booking/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 2. Landlord goi lai cho cung Booking (tra hop dong da ton tai, khong tao trung)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/from-booking/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 3. Tenant xem danh sach hop dong
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 4. Landlord loc hop dong theo trang thai Draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts?status=Draft&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 5. Tenant xem chi tiet hop dong cua minh
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 6. Landlord cap nhat hop dong Draft
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2027-01-01",
  "endDate": "2027-12-31",
  "monthlyRent": 4500000,
  "depositAmount": 4500000,
  "paymentDueDay": 5,
  "terms": "Thanh toan tien thue truoc ngay 05 hang thang."
}

### 7. Landlord gui hop dong cho hai ben xac nhan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 8. Kiem tra page khong hop le (mong doi 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts?page=0&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 9. Kiem tra pageSize vuot gioi han (mong doi 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts?page=1&pageSize=51
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
